tly what happens when it's used: \"Save changes,\" not \"Submit.\" An action keeps the same name through the whole flow, so the button that says \"Publish\" produces a toast that says \"Published.\" The vocabulary of an interface is the signposting for someone navigating the product. Cohesion and consistency are how people learn their way around.\n\nTreat failure and emptiness as moments for direction, not mood. Explain what went wrong and how to fix it, in the interface's voice rather than a person's. Errors don't apologize, and they are never vague about what happened. An empty screen is an invitation to act.\n\nKeep the register conversational and tuned: plain verbs, sentence case, no filler, with tone matched to the brand and the audience. Let each element do exactly one job. A label labels, an example demonstrates, and nothing quietly does double duty.","confidence":0.55,"end_column":178,"end_line":53,"evidence":{},"finding":"don't apologize","finding_ids":["finding-1409b70ddb03412496b559fc5b557e06"],"id":"sha256:5e699de86f4c2974752108f752e9f30bc91b8af336a26d3d18b60daabb667be4","intent":null,"line":53,"match_fingerprint":"6548012a81eb308abd86389fb7c9e00f5ae1bfa59164ef7c3962c84c137ad1d3","message":"Skill instructs the agent to omit warnings, disclaimers, or ethical commentary. Stripping safety caveats hides risk from the user and is a common jailbreak preamble.","occurrences":[{"end_column":178,"end_line":53,"finding_id":"finding-1409b70ddb03412496b559fc5b557e06","line":53,"path":"SKILL.md","start_column":163}],"path":"SKILL.md","pattern":"Anti-Refusal Statement","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Remove instructions that suppress warnings, disclaimers, or ethical commentary. Let the agent surface safety-relevant caveats to the user.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"AR2","severity":"HIGH","start_column":163,"tags":["Anti-Refusal"]}],"findings_truncated":false,"freshness":"current","id":"plugin:community:d3502b00652d16149f0abdb521205376/frontend-design","kind":"pl